<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessels loading and movements at June 24.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessels loading and movements at June 24.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry and</p>
<p>independent surveyors detailed rice loading at Thai ports as</p>
<p>follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel		Date of Arrival   Quantity     Destination</p>
<p>HALLVARD	    11/06/97		5,000	  Dubai</p>
<p>BUDI AIN	    12/06/97		3,800	  Malaysia</p>
<p>YUE LUSHAN	  13/06/97		6,500	  Philippines</p>
<p>POLAR STAR	  13/06/97	     21,500	  Iraq</p>
<p>DELIGHT GLORY     13/06/97	     12,400	  Philippines</p>
<p>MORNING STAR	13/06/97	     18,000	  Iraq</p>
<p>ASIAN PROGRESS    16/06/97		8,500	  Nigeria</p>
<p>LAEMTHONG BRIDE   16/06/97	     12,500	  Nigeria</p>
<p>Bang Khuntien     17/06/97		5,700	  Malaysia</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
